{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117275","id":3376226613,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc7JPSE1","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117275","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117275.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/117275.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117275","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117275/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/117275/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/117275/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/7f7677f281fee7b1cb5568ccc95d7cf1e331735b","number":117275,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add `SyncMode::CYCLIC` to BlendSpace1D and BlendSpace2D","user":{"login":"uno1982","id":45907836,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1OTA3ODM2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/45907836?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982","html_url":"https://github.com/uno1982","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/uno1982/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes godotengine/godot-proposals#13307\r\n\r\nReplaces the boolean `sync` property with a `SyncMode` enum on both `AnimationNodeBlendSpace1D` and `AnimationNodeBlendSpace2D`:\r\n\r\n- **SYNC_MODE_NONE**: Inactive animations are frozen (previous default).\r\n- **SYNC_MODE_INDEPENDENT**: Inactive animations advance at weight=0 (previous `sync=true`).\r\n- **SYNC_MODE_CYCLIC_MUTABLE**: All animations are time-scaled so they complete one cycle in the same duration, using a weighted-average length computed each frame from active blend points. Solo animations play at normal speed.\r\n- **SYNC_MODE_CYCLIC_CONSTANT**: All animations are time-scaled to complete one cycle in a user-specified `cyclic_length` duration.\r\n\r\n### How Cyclic Mutable works\r\nAnimation lengths are cached when blend points change (via `lengths_dirty` flag). Each frame, a weighted-average period is computed from the cached lengths of active blend points:\r\n\r\navg_length = Σ(weight_i × length_i) / Σ(weight_i)\r\n\r\nEach animation's delta is then scaled by `length_i / avg_length`, so a 1s walk and a 2s run both complete their cycles at the same normalized rate. When only one animation is active, `factor = length / length = 1.0`, so it plays at normal speed.\r\n\r\n### How Cyclic Constant works\r\nEach animation's delta is scaled by `length_i / cyclic_length`, where `cyclic_length` is a user-specified property. This provides deterministic timing regardless of which animations are blending.\r\n\r\n### GDExtension API compatibility\r\nThe original `sync` property is preserved as bool with `set_use_sync`/`is_using_sync` (`PROPERTY_USAGE_NONE`) so the extension API contract from 4.0–4.6 is unchanged. The new `sync_mode` property (int enum, `PROPERTY_USAGE_NO_EDITOR`) is the actual serialized property.\r\n\r\nOld scenes with `sync = true` load through `set_use_sync(true)` → `SYNC_MODE_INDEPENDENT`.\r\n\r\n### Editor changes\r\nThe sync checkbox is replaced with a four-item OptionButton (None / Independent / Cyclic Mutable / Cyclic Constant) in both BlendSpace1D and BlendSpace2D editors. The `cyclic_length` SpinBox is only visible when Cyclic Constant is selected.\r\n\r\n### Limitations\r\n- Cyclic modes assume each blend point contains a single animation cycle of finite length. Blend points with zero or infinite length will play at their original speed.\r\n- Animations that are out of phase (e.g., left foot forward vs. right foot forward) may still need manual alignment via Start Offset in Custom Timeline.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":2666705648,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNjY2NzA1NjQ4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:animation","name":"topic:animation","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/24","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/24/labels","number":24,"state":"closed","title":"4.7","description":"","creator":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/repos",